{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.fullMass_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.fullMass_eq","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/VolumeBridge.lean#L121-L124","doc":"`fullMass` unfolds to the volume term under the bridge. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.fullMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.fullMass","kind":"def","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/VolumeBridge.lean#L118-L119","doc":"The full categorical mass, as a definition (descended + transient). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.fullMass_eq_volTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.fullMass_eq_volTerm","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/VolumeBridge.lean#L111-L116","doc":"**Full categorical mass = volume term** (Step 2), derived from the bridge:\nthe descended trace plus the transient tower equals `Vol(K_β)/ℏ_q²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.transient_identity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.transient_identity","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/VolumeBridge.lean#L102-L109","doc":"**The transient identity** of `conj:mass-endomorphism`, derived from the\nbridge:\n`tr_M(Φ^trans) = Vol(K_β)/ℏ_q² − |tr_M(ρ(β))|`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.archimedean_bridge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.archimedean_bridge","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/VolumeBridge.lean#L96-L96","doc":"The open Volume-Conjecture bridge at `q_0`: the descended trace plus the\ntransient tower realises the volume term. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.volTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.volTerm","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/VolumeBridge.lean#L93-L93","doc":"Volume term `Vol(K_β)/ℏ_q²` (Step 2, proved). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.transient","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.transient","kind":"def","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/VolumeBridge.lean#L91-L91","doc":"Brane-tower transient sum `Σ Φ_q(z_i)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.descTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.descTrace","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/VolumeBridge.lean#L89-L89","doc":"Descended Markov trace `|tr_M(ρ(β))|` (Step 1, proved). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge.mk","kind":"ctor","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/VolumeBridge.lean#L87-L87","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.VolumeBridge","kind":"class","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassEndomorphism/VolumeBridge.lean#L74-L96","doc":"**The Volume-Conjecture bridge (open input of `conj:mass-endomorphism`).**\n\nOver a commutative ring `R ⊇ ℤ[q^±1]` and a braid type `β`:\n- `descTrace : R` — the descended Markov trace `|tr_M(ρ(β))|` (Step 1,\n  proved; at the archimedean realisation `R = ℝ` it is the absolute value);\n- `transient : R` — the brane-tower transient sum `Σ Φ_q(z_i)`;\n- `volTerm : R` — the volume term `Vol(K_β)/ℏ_q²` (Step 2, proved);\n- `archimedean_bridge` — the **sole open field**: the Volume-Conjecture\n  equality at `q_0`, `volTerm = descTrace + transient`, asserting the\n  transient tower closes the Jones→Volume gap.\n\nCarries no instance: this is an honest open primary (§3b-tax). ","signatureChunk":0}]}